    "path": "datafusion_functions_aggregate_common::aggregate::groups_accumulator::accumulate::accumulate",
    "name": "accumulate",
    "owner": null,
    "crate": "datafusion-functions-aggregate-common",
    "version": "55.1.0",
    "kind": "function",
    "signature": "fn accumulate<T, F>(group_indices: &[usize], values: &arrow::array::PrimitiveArray<T>, opt_filter: Option<&arrow::array::BooleanArray>, value_fn: F) where T: ArrowPrimitiveType + Send, F: FnMut(usize, T::Native) + Send",
    "docs": "Invokes `value_fn(group_index, value)` for each non null, non\nfiltered value of `value`,\n\n# Arguments:\n\n* `group_indices`:  To which groups do the rows in `values` belong, (aka group_index)\n* `values`: the input arguments to the accumulator\n* `opt_filter`: if present, only rows for which is Some(true) are included\n* `value_fn`: function invoked for  (group_index, value) where value is non null\n\n# Example\n\n```text\n ┌─────────┐   ┌─────────┐   ┌ ─ ─ ─ ─ ┐\n │ ┌─────┐ │   │ ┌─────┐ │     ┌─────┐\n │ │  2  │ │   │ │ 200 │ │   │ │  t  │ │\n │ ├─────┤ │   │ ├─────┤ │     ├─────┤\n │ │  2  │ │   │ │ 100 │ │   │ │  f  │ │\n │ ├─────┤ │   │ ├─────┤ │     ├─────┤\n │ │  0  │ │   │ │ 200 │ │   │ │  t  │ │\n │ ├─────┤ │   │ ├─────┤ │     ├─────┤\n │ │  1  │ │   │ │ 200 │ │   │ │NULL │ │\n │ ├─────┤ │   │ ├─────┤ │     ├─────┤\n │ │  0  │ │   │ │ 300 │ │   │ │  t  │ │\n │ └─────┘ │   │ └─────┘ │     └─────┘\n └─────────┘   └─────────┘   └ ─ ─ ─ ─ ┘\n\ngroup_indices   values        opt_filter\n```\n\nIn the example above, `value_fn` is invoked for each (group_index,\nvalue) pair where `opt_filter[i]` is true and values is non null\n\n```text\nvalue_fn(2, 200)\nvalue_fn(0, 200)\nvalue_fn(0, 300)\n```",
